      "id": "a1948784-9fb7-40e2-9e88-8e25e43ccc27",
      "name": "Activity",
      "description": {
        "content": "An activity is a record of an interaction with the GoFundMe Pro platform.\nActivity types include creating a new donation, creating a new fundraising page or team, adding a new team member, and more.\nActivities are not created directly via the API, but are generated as a side-effect of user interaction with other parts of the GoFundMe Pro system.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
